hteen yll\u00e4, liit\u00e4 t\u00e4h\u00e4n tarkka, SUORA ja SANATARKKA lainaus teoriasta/l\u00e4hteest\u00e4, joka tukee perusteluasi. Teko\u00e4lyn luoma oma teksti on t\u00e4ss\u00e4 kielletty. Jos l\u00e4hdett\u00e4 ei ole, palauta null.", "title": "Matrix Archivist Cited Text Quote"}, "block_taskarchivist": {"description": "TASK_ARCHIVIST: ROLE: ARCHIVIST (Best Practices & Precedent Audit)\nYour task is to ensure that the user's action and decision-making seen in the material align with previous precedents (Relevant Cases) and organizational standards.\n\nOUTPUT REQUIREMENT:\nThe response must be JSON conforming to the `ArchivistOutput` schema.\nMANDATE: Output your response EXACTLY according to the JSON schema.\nWARNING: Return 'relevant_cases' as a list and provide the 'compliance_analysis' score strictly utilizing the defined BARS matrix.\n{{SCHEMA_EXAMPLE}}", "title": "Block Taskarchivist", "type": "integer"}, "block_taskarchivist_justification": {"description": "Detailed reasoning for the assigned score for 'TASK_ARCHIVIST'. Must explicitly adhere to the active STRICTNESS CALIBRATION.", "title": "Block Taskarchivist Justification", "type": "string"}, "block_taskarchivist_cited_source_id": {"anyOf": [{"type": "string"}, {"type": "null"}], "default": null, "description": "T\u00e4lle kriteerille ei ole autoktorisoitua l\u00e4hdett\u00e4. Palauta EHDOTTOMASTI aina null.", "title": "Block Taskarchivist Cited Source Id"}, "block_taskarchivist_cited_text_quote": {"anyOf": [{"type": "string"}, {"type": "null"}], "default": null, "description": "JOS valitsit l\u00e4hteen yll\u00e4, liit\u00e4 t\u00e4h\u00e4n tarkka, SUORA ja SANATARKKA lainaus teoriasta/l\u00e4hteest\u00e4, joka tukee perusteluasi. Teko\u00e4lyn luoma oma teksti on t\u00e4ss\u00e4 kielletty. Jos l\u00e4hdett\u00e4 ei ole, palauta null.", "title": "Block Taskarchivist Cited Text Quote"}}, "required": ["matrix_archivist", "matrix_archivist_justification", "block_taskarchivist", "block_taskarchivist_justification"], "title": "Step_step_archivist_Response", "type": "object"}, "step_logician": {"properties": {"matrix_toulmin": {"description": "Toulminin Argumentaatio: Arvioi argumentin laatua Toulminin mallin mukaisesti.", "title": "Matrix Toulmin", "type": "number"}, "matrix_toulmin_justification": {"description": "Detailed reasoning for the assigned score for 'Toulminin Argumentaatio'. Must explicitly adhere to the active STRICTNESS CALIBRATION.", "title": "Matrix Toulmin Justification", "type": "string"}, "matrix_toulmin_cited_source_id": {"anyOf": [{"const": "Toulmin, Stephen E. 2003. The uses of argument.", "type": "string"}, {"type": "null"}], "default": null, "description": "Jos perustelut viittaavat johonkin ohjeistettuun teoriaan, PALAUTA T\u00c4SM\u00c4LLEEN T\u00c4M\u00c4 merkkijono: 'Toulmin, Stephen E. 2003. The uses of argument.'. Muuten palauta null.", "title": "Matrix Toulmin Cited Source Id"}, "matrix_toulmin_cited_text_quote": {"anyOf": [{"type": "string"}, {"type": "null"}], "default": null, "description": "JOS valitsit l\u00e4hteen yll\u00e4, liit\u00e4 t\u00e4h\u00e4n tarkka, SUORA ja SANATARKKA lainaus teoriasta/l\u00e4hteest\u00e4, joka tukee perusteluasi. Teko\u00e4lyn luoma oma teksti on t\u00e4ss\u00e4 kielletty. Jos l\u00e4hdett\u00e4 ei ole, palauta null.", "title": "Matrix Toulmin Cited Text Quote"}, "matrix_bloom": {"description": "Bloomin Taksonomia: Arvioi kognitiivista syvyytt\u00e4 Bloomin taksonomian perusteella.", "title": "Matrix Bloom", "type": "number"}, "matrix_bloom_justification": {"description": "Detailed reasoning for the assigned score for 'Bloomin Taksonomia'. Must explicitly adhere to the active STRICTNESS CALIBRATION.", "title": "Matrix Bloom Justification", "type": "string"}, "matrix_bloom_cited_source_id": {"anyOf": [{"const": "Anderson, Lorin W. & Krathwohl, David R. (toim.) 2001.", "type": "string"}, {"type": "null"}], "default": null, "description": "Jos perustelut viittaavat johonkin ohjeistettuun teoriaan, PAL